  "description": "An interactive API debugging and exploration tool for .NET applications. Automatically discovers your HTTP endpoints and provides an UI designed specifically for real-time testing and debugging. Features an advanced request builder with cURL import/export, dynamic payload generation, detailed response analysis, and a dedicated SignalR Debug Tool for seamless WebSocket and hub testing.",
